{"id":"repre_sentant","lemma":"représentant","pos":"noun","rank":3127,"glosses":["representative"],"ipa":"/ʁə.pʁe.zɑ̃.tɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/Fr-repr%C3%A9sentant.ogg/Fr-repr%C3%A9sentant.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"représentants","feminine":"représentante"},"formAudio":{"représentants":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-repr%C3%A9sentants.wav","représentante":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-repr%C3%A9sentante.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous avons nommé notre représentant.","en":"We've chosen our representative.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to nominate","l":"nommer"},{"g":"our"},null]},{"text":"Nous l'avons désigné comme notre représentant.","en":"We appointed him as our representative.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to designate","l":"désigner"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"our"},null]},{"text":"Ils élisent leurs représentants dans un isoloir.","en":"They elect their representatives in a voting booth.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"them","l":"leur"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"On élit un représentant par le vote.","en":"You elect your representative by voting.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},null,{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"vote"}]},{"text":"Des représentants de nombreux pays ont participé à la conférence.","en":"Delegates from many countries participated in the conference.","words":[{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"numerous, many"},{"g":"land"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to participate","l":"participer"},null,null,{"g":"conference"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"a la"]]}]}